          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="cav">People also read</div>
        <h2>Keep going</h2>
        <div class="sec">
          <ul class="pillars">
            <li><span class="dot">&rarr;</span><div><b><a href="/playbooks/pdf-to-word-converter/">Convert a PDF to Word, Nothing Uploaded</a></b> Another file tool that keeps your document on your device.</div></li>
            <li><span class="dot">&rarr;</span><div><b><a href="/playbooks/markdown-editor/">Where Does Your Text Go in a Markdown Editor?</a></b> The same local-first principle, for writing.</div></li>
            <li><span class="dot">&rarr;</span><div><b><a href="/playbooks/free-online-tools/">70+ Free Online Tools, Nothing Uploaded</a></b> The overview of every Best Answer Hub hub.</div></li>
            <li><span class="dot">&rarr;</span><div><b><a href="/knowledge-center/ai-knowledge-test/">The Free AI Knowledge Test</a></b> A no-signup check of how well you really understand AI.</div></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h2>Sources</h2>
        <ul class="sources">
          <li>OpenAI Help Center, <a href="https://help.openai.com/en/articles/7260999-how-do-i-export-my-chatgpt-history-and-data" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Export your ChatGPT history</a>, 2026 (Settings path; link expires after 24 hours; ZIP).</li>
          <li>OpenAI Help Center, <a href="https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9106926-transfer-exported-conversations-between-chatgpt-accounts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Transfer exported conversations</a>, 2026 (conversations.json is the core file).</li>
          <li>Anthropic Privacy Center, <a href="https://privacy.claude.com/en/articles/9450526-how-can-i-export-my-claude-data" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Export your Claude data</a>, 2026 (Settings, Privacy; link expires 24 hours after delivery).</li>
          <li>OpenAI Developer Community, <a href="https://community.openai.com/t/questions-about-the-json-structures-in-the-exported-conversations-json/954762" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">JSON structure of conversations.json</a>, 2026 (community-described node/parent/children tree; no official schema).</li>
          <li>Stanford HAI, <a href="https://hai.stanford.edu/news/be-careful-what-you-tell-your-ai-chatbot" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Be careful what you tell your AI chatbot</a>, 2025 (chat data is sensitive and trained on by default absent an opt-out).</li>
          <li>FTC, <a href="https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/protecting-personal-information-guide-business" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Protecting Personal Information</a> (do not collect sensitive data you do not need).</li>
          <li>MDN Web Docs, <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/File_API/Using_files_from_web_applications" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Using files from web applications</a>, 2026 (the browser reads local files on the client).</li>
          <li>GDPR, <a href="https://gdpr-info.eu/art-20-gdpr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Article 20, Right to data portability</a>, 2018 (machine-readable export).</li>
